{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And the daughter</b> — If it concerns David, the bet is lacking, and thus (Psalms 9:14) <b>ובת צר</b> alongside <b>בת צור</b>, and the object is \"all her glory.\" And if it concerns the Messiah, it is by way of parable."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:30:55.003419302Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}